*Shane is a brand experience strategist and Senior Industry Fellow in the School of Economics, Finance & Marketing at RMIT. He advises brands on MarTech, brand experience and consumer behaviour. Despite decades of evidence to the contrary, he still foolishly thinks he is the one making choices about the brands he buys.*
